# The Font Manager's messages, in TAIRiX Bridge's own words.
UnnamedSize:No bitmap file can be named for that size
UndefinedColour:No colours are set for the font's foreground in this mode
BadColours:The anti-aliasing colours are out of range
InvalidColour:A font colour is not one of the mode's
Undefined:That font handle holds no font
OutOfRange:Font handle out of range
NotFound:Font '%0' not found
NoData:Font '%0' has no outlines or bitmaps for its encoding
NoHandles:Every font handle is in use
CtrlChar:A font string holds a control character it may not
Reserved:A flag or field that must be nought is not
BadMatrix:The font's matrix is not six numbers
ZeroSize:A font cannot be nought points
Transformed:A transformed font's metrics cannot be read
NoRGB:The font colours were not set as RGB colours
NoEncoding:Encoding '%0' not found
NoSupremacy:Text cannot blend with the screen's supremacy in this mode
Illegal:A file of font '%0' is not a font file
NotPath:A font directory must end with a full stop
FontsClaimed:Fonts are in use, so the font cache cannot be loaded
NotCache:That file is not a saved font cache
FontList:Font List
Regular:(Regular)
SystemFont:System Font
ListHeading:     Font                   Size                 Dots/inch  Uses Memory
ListRule:     ----                   ----                 ---------  ---- ------
MasterFace:master, a TAIRiX face
MasterFiles:master, outlines
CacheSize:Cache size:
CacheFree:      free:
